    "doi": "10.21203/rs.3.rs-10580069/v1",
    "date": "2026-11-09",
    "authors": "Cruz-Cavalieri D, Gracia-Zamacona C, Grotenhuis J, Santos PSd, Palazuelos-Cagigas SE.",
